<p class="lead">Changed your mind? You can return unused items within 30 days of delivery for a full refund.</p>
<h2>How to return</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Email <a href="mailto:<%= settings.store_email %>"><%= settings.store_email %></a> with your order number.</li>
  <li>We’ll send you a returns reference and address.</li>
  <li>Pack the item securely in its original packaging.</li>
  <li>Once received and inspected, we’ll refund you within 5 working days.</li>
</ol>
<h2>Exceptions</h2>
<p>Items that have been installed, used or cut to size cannot be returned unless faulty. Your statutory rights under the Consumer Rights Act 2015 are not affected.</p>
<h2>Faulty items</h2>
<p>If something is faulty, contact us and we’ll arrange a repair, replacement or refund – and cover the cost of return.</p>
